<section
    class="canva-section chapter paper"
    data-template-id="iscoms-section"
    id="iscoms"
    style="background: rgb(23, 33, 51);"
>
    <div class="chapter-inner">
        <div class="max-w-2xl mb-12">
            <p
                class="canva-text eyebrow mb-5"
                data-template-id="iscoms-kicker"
                style="color: rgb(229, 183, 183); font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-size: 13px;"
            >
                Chapter two &middot; In the scrapbook
            </p>
            <h2
                class="canva-text chapter-title"
                data-template-id="iscoms-title"
                style="color: rgb(248, 241, 230); font-weight: 500; font-style: normal; font-size: 26px;"
            >
                ISCOMS
            </h2>
            <p
                class="canva-text body-copy mt-7"
                data-template-id="iscoms-intro"
                style="color: rgb(223, 214, 204); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 18px;"
            >
                A whole chapter for the experiences and moments connected to
                ISCOMS. Leave your favorite photographs and the little details
                you never want to forget here.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-[1.1fr_.9fr] gap-9 lg:gap-14 items-start">
            <figure class="lg:-rotate-2">
                <div class="photo-frame rounded-xl h-[330px] sm:h-[470px]">
                    <img
                        alt="Atmospheric architecture placeholder, ready for an ISCOMS memory photograph"
                        class="canva-image"
                        data-template-id="iscoms-photo-one"
                        loading="lazy"
                        src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/289737/pexels-photo-289737.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=800"
                    />
                    <span
                        class="canva-tag photo-tag"
                        data-template-id="iscoms-photo-one-label"
                        style="background: rgb(34, 43, 57); color: rgb(248, 241, 230); font-weight: 600; font-style: normal; font-size: 13px;"
                        >Add an ISCOMS photo</span
                    >
                </div>
                <figcaption
                    class="canva-text mt-5 text-center"
                    data-template-id="iscoms-photo-one-caption"
                    style="color: rgb(196, 185, 182); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 15px;"
                >
                    Add a caption for this moment.
                </figcaption>
            </figure>
            <div class="space-y-8 lg:pt-12">
                <div
                    class="canva-card quiet-card p-7 sm:p-9"
                    data-template-id="iscoms-note-card"
                    style="background: rgb(37, 46, 61);"
                >
                    <span aria-hidden="true" class="text-[#d7b878] text-2xl"
                        >✳</span
                    >
                    <h3
                        class="canva-text serif mt-3"
                        data-template-id="iscoms-note-title"
                        style="color: rgb(248, 241, 230); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 25px;"
                    >
                        A little memory note
                    </h3>
                    <p
                        class="canva-text body-copy mt-3"
                        data-template-id="iscoms-note-copy"
                        style="color: rgb(223, 214, 204); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 16px;"
                    >
                        What is one small ISCOMS moment you would love to
                        remember together? Write it here.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <figure class="max-w-[440px] lg:ml-auto lg:rotate-3">
                    <div class="photo-frame rounded-xl h-[250px] sm:h-[290px]">
                        <img
                            alt="Softly colored notebook placeholder, ready for a second ISCOMS memory photograph"
                            class="canva-image"
                            data-template-id="iscoms-photo-two"
                            loading="lazy"
                            src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/1029604/pexels-photo-1029604.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=800"
                        />
                        <span
                            class="canva-tag photo-tag"
                            data-template-id="iscoms-photo-two-label"
                            style="background: rgb(34, 43, 57); color: rgb(248, 241, 230); font-weight: 600; font-style: normal; font-size: 13px;"
                            >Add another photo</span
                        >
                    </div>
                    <figcaption
                        class="canva-text mt-4 text-center"
                        data-template-id="iscoms-photo-two-caption"
                        style="color: rgb(196, 185, 182); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 15px;"
                    >
                        And another little piece of the story.
                    </figcaption>
                </figure>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex justify-center mt-12">
            <a
                aria-label="Continue to Bengali music"
                class="canva-link section-next"
                data-template-id="iscoms-next"
                href="#music"
                style="color: rgb(255, 244, 223); font-weight: 600; font-style: normal; font-size: 15px;"
                >Next chapter &darr;</a
            >
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
